ations, staking locks and monthly-revenue-linked buybacks.","claim_type":"token","support_direction":"supports","analyst_note":"Numbers are issuer reported; team retains authority to alter treasury distribution terms.","checked_at":"2026-07-29"},{"claim_id":"casino:claim:betfury:revenue-mechanics","case_id":"betfury-bfg-ecosystem","field_path":"token.fee_revenue_rights","source_id":"casino:source:betfury:bfg-legacy","evidence_locator":"Legacy page describes revenue share/profit distribution as original utility; current tokenomics reframes value flow through staking, buybacks, treasury incentives and burns.","claim_type":"context","support_direction":"supports","analyst_note":"No fixed, audited or irrevocable holder right is inferred.","checked_at":"2026-07-29"}],"licences":[],"observations":[{"observation_id":"casino:observation:betfury:bfg-burned","case_id":"betfury-bfg-ecosystem","metric_dimension":"declared_cumulative_token_burn","value":1665842606,"unit":"token","currency":"BFG","window_start":null,"window_end":null,"window_definition":"Current issuer tokenomics snapshot with no explicit observation date on the reviewed surface.","as_of":"2026-07-29","product_scope":"BFG token","chain_scope":["BNB Smart Chain"],"method":"Transcribed from current BetFury tokenomics.","formula":"reported burned BFG","raw_input_ids":[],"source_claim_ids":["casino:claim:betfury:tokenomics-current"],"quality_flags":["issuer_reported","snapshot_date_unknown","not_revenue"]}],"events":[{"event_id":"casino:event:betfury:bfg-launch:2021-06-21","case_id":"betfury-bfg-ecosystem","event_type":"token_launch","event_date":"2021-06-21","date_precision":"day","amount_usd":null,"description":"BetFury says BFG launched as its ecosystem token.","source_claim_ids":["casino:claim:betfury:lifecycle"]},{"event_id":"casino:event:betfury:mining-end:2023-06-13","case_id":"betfury-bfg-ecosystem","event_type":"migration","event_date":"2023-06-13","date_precision":"day","amount_usd":null,"description":"Gameplay-based BFG mining ended after the declared 5 billion emission was reached.","source_claim_ids":["casino:claim:betfury:lifecycle"]}],"forensic_analysis":{"version":"forensic-analysis-v1","outcome":{"label":"middling","summary":"BetFury''s BFG ecosystem remains active and has progressed from gameplay mining to burns, locks, buybacks and treasury incentives. It is classified middling because current operator, licence, audited casino economics and canonical contract evidence remain unresolved despite a substantial documented token lifecycle.","confidence":"medium","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg","https://docs.betfury.com/betfury/bfg-token-overview/tokenomics","https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg/bfg-legacy"]},"why":{"summary":"Gameplay mining bootstrapped distribution and the post-mining design retained utility through wagering, staking, burns and treasury incentives. The same flexibility leaves benefits dependent on operator disclosures and modifiable program rules, while absent legal-entity and audited-performance evidence caps the assessment.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg","https://docs.betfury.com/betfury/bfg-token-overview/tokenomics","https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg/bfg-legacy"]},"strategic_choices":[{"decision":"Distribute BFG through gameplay mining until a fixed 5 billion emission was reached.","consequence":"The mechanism aligned early play with token distribution but created a large supply and ended as a continuing acquisition loop in June 2023.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg/bfg-legacy"]},{"decision":"Shift post-mining token economics toward burns, locks, buybacks and a treasury.","consequence":"The design maintains token demand and incentives after emissions, while increasing reliance on operator-controlled allocation and revenue reporting.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/betfury/bfg-token-overview/tokenomics"]},{"decision":"Integrate BFG into casino and sportsbook utility rather than make it only a governance token.","consequence":"Direct product use can sustain a utility loop, but it also ties token demand to gambling activity and custodial-platform continuity.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg"]}],"counterfactual":{"summary":"Continuing open-ended gameplay mining likely would have increased dilution; ending utility after mining likely would have weakened demand. A fixed, enforceable revenue right could strengthen direct value capture but create different legal and balance-sheet obligations.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/betfury/bfg-token-overview/tokenomics","https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg/bfg-legacy"]},"watch":[{"signal":"Monthly buybacks, treasury distributions, burns and stBFG unlocks.","implication":"These show whether post-mining utility persists or becomes increasingly discretionary.","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/betfury/bfg-token-overview/tokenomics"]},{"signal":"Publication of current legal operator, licence and canonical BFG contract.","implication":"Resolving identity and legal scope could materially raise confidence.","source_refs":["https://docs.betfury.com/white-paper/about-bfg"]}],"unknowns":["What entity currently operates betfury.com and under which licence?","What is the canonical current BFG contract address?","What are audited GGR, player liabilities and active-player counts?","How much buyback and reward activity comes from sustainable revenue rather than treasury inventory?"],"review":{"status":"current","last_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","next_review_at":"2026-08-05","reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk"}},"synthesis":{"present_situation":"BFG remains documented as an active BetFury utility token after gameplay mining ended in 2023.","business_mechanism":"A custodial casino and sportsbook connects GGR, staking, bonuses, buybacks, treasury incentives and burns to BFG.","token_contribution":"BFG provides repeat product utility and post-mining incentives, but current benefits remain operator-designed and modifiable.","chain_dependence":"BFG is described as BEP-20 on BNB Smart Chain; casino balances and game execution remain custodial.","risk_legal_posture":"Current operator, licence, canonical contract and audited economics were not established by reviewed sources.","success_failure_hypotheses":"A lifecycle transition preserved token relevance after emissions; opacity and discretion prevent a stronger outcome label.","counterfactual":"Unlimited mining would dilute; a token with no post-mining utility would likely lose product relevance.","outlook":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","product_status":"active","token_status":"active but partly opaque","scope_guard":"No legal-compliance, solvency or return claim."},"lessons_learned":["Mining termination is a lifecycle transition, not proof of token failure.","Issuer-reported buybacks need entity, contract and revenue verification."],"source_claim_ids":["casino:claim:betfury:token-identity","casino:claim:betfury:lifecycle","casino:claim:betfury:tokenomics-current","casino:claim:betfury:revenue-mechanics"],"analyst_id":"chaindump-research-desk","reviewed_at":"2026-07-29"}},{"case":{"case_id":"winr-protocol-bankroll","brand_name":"WINR Protocol","entity_kind":"bankroll_protocol","product_subtype":"bankroll","legal_operator":null,"parent_entity":null,"primary_domain":"winr.games","launched":"2022","date_precision":"year","custody_model":"noncustodial","chains":["Arbitrum"],"product_scope_note":"This case covers the current WINR Protocol shared-bankroll and creator-infrastructure thesis at winr.games, including WINR as bankroll and wagering asset. Historical Tron, Polygon and JustBet applications are context only. It excludes similarly named tokens and does not treat protocol contracts as a gambling licence for any frontend or jurisdiction.","status":"active","status_as_of":"2026-07-29","outcome_label":"successful","outcome_as_of":"2026-07-29","outcome_rule_id":"casino-wave6-onchain-infrastructure-adoption-v1","token_status":"documented","token_symbol":"WINR","token_name":"WINR","token_contracts":[],"token_launch_date":null,"token_utility":"WINR is the wagering chip, bankroll denomination and liquidity asset; USDC deposits are automatically swapped into WINR.","token_fee_revenue_rights":"Current documentation says 100% of net gaming revenue flows into the bankroll and liquidity-provider share value changes through the WINR-per-share exchange rate. Returns are variable and not guaranteed.","token_supply":{},"cohort_id":"web3-casino-wave6-2026-07-29","cohort_role":"case","selection_rule_id":"casino-wave6-product-model-contrast-v1","selection_as_of":"2026-07-29","confidence":"medium","completeness_pct":90,"quality_passed":1,"human_review_required":0,"unsourced_fields":["legal_entity","gaming_licence","canonical_token_contract","audited_volume","audited_unique_wallet_attribution","current_active_players","current_protocol_revenue"],"last_reviewed":"2026-07-29","updated_at":"2026-07-29"},"sources":[{"source_id":"casino:source:winr:history-2026","canonical_url":"https://docs.winr.games/history","title":"History & Roadmap","publisher":"WINR Protocol","published_at":"2026","accessed_at":"2026-07-29","source_tier":"B","source_role":"primary","resolving":1,"evidence_reviewed":1,"evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk","notes":"Issuer chronology and self-reported historical adoption; not independently audited."},{"source_id":"casino:source:winr:token-2026","canonical_url":"https://docs.winr.games/winr-token","title":"WINR Token","publisher":"WINR Protocol","published_at":"2026-05-29","accessed_at":"2026-07-29","source_tier":"B","source_role":"primary","resolving":1,"evidence_reviewed":1,"evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk","notes":"Current token and revenue-flow documentation; linked explorer address was not normalized into this dossier."},{"source_id":"casino:source:winr:liquidity-2026","canonical_url":"https://docs.winr.games/liquidity-providers","title":"Liquidity Providers","publisher":"WINR Protocol","published_at":"2026-05-30","accessed_at":"2026-07-29","source_tier":"B","source_role":"primary","resolving":1,"evidence_reviewed":1,"evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk","notes":"Current bankroll mechanics and risk limits; displayed yields are variable and not guaranteed."},{"source_id":"casino:source:winr:home-2026","canonical_url":"https://www.winr.games/","title":"WINR — The AI casino system","publisher":"WINR Protocol","accessed_at":"2026-07-29","source_tier":"B","source_role":"primary","resolving":1,"evidence_reviewed":1,"evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk","notes":"Current product surface for creator studio and bankroll; live metric values did not render in the reviewed snapshot and are not transcribed."}],"claims":[{"claim_id":"casino:claim:winr:formation-migration","case_id":"winr-protocol-bankroll","field_path":"launched.chains.product_model","source_id":"casino:source:winr:history-2026","evidence_locator":"History says WINR Protocol formed as separate shared gambling infrastructure in 2022 and moved core contracts to Arbitrum with a decentralized bankroll.","claim_type":"event","support_direction":"supports","analyst_note":"Earlier Tron and Polygon experiments are not classified as the current protocol.","checked_at":"2026-07-29"},{"claim_id":"casino:claim:winr:historical-adoption","case_id":"winr-protocol-bankroll","field_path":"metrics.historical_volume_wallets","source_id":"casino:source:winr:history-2026","evidence_locator":"Issuer reports more than $250 million processed volume and more than 40,000 unique wallets by end-2025, after over $150 million